    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Vista is a modern dark-style WordPress child theme built upon the powerful WENS Haelo theme framework. It is specifically designed for travel agencies, tour operators, adventure businesses, trekking companies, and travel bloggers. This theme provides an elegant and immersive platform to showcase destinations, travel experiences, services, and stories. Featuring a stylish dark design, visually appealing layouts, and image-focused sections, WENS Vista helps create a premium online presence that captures the spirit of exploration and adventure. As a child theme of WENS Haelo, it inherits the flexibility, customization options, and reliable foundation of its parent theme while offering a distinctive travel-oriented appearance. With its responsive design and engaging homepage sections, WENS Vista includes destination showcases, featured trips, testimonials, galleries, and call-to-action areas. It is an ideal choice for creating a professional, attractive, and user-friendly travel and tourism website."
    },
